  "claim_scope": "Fixed CommonWords is the dependent finite direct sum of the original complete native coefficient words at each source-generated actual admission site, retaining exact site and native grade. Existing component projection restricts a complete word at that site; installed raw projection supplies the old Env and original materialAtStop supplies its real native increment. Existing updateInventory/liftMap derive the actual old/effect observation. Prefix contains only these generated native observations; original prefix restriction derives Compatible rather than accepting it. Existing scalar Data completionMap/source_to_evaluator and existing CofinalKernel.zero_iff give the complete joint fibre, characterized by the original pairEnv relationMap range at every site. From the same actual native material, N.input.environment and additionReadout generate updatedData and an existing Naturality.Morphism; completionMorphism_source_naturality gives the whole coefficient Env update. Registered source word and local native residual word remain separate; actual residual observer is (0, original source effect).",
