    "ordered_mixed": "nativeInventory is original updateInventory = old evaluation × effect evaluator. actual_inventory_square uses original evaluation_liftMap. Existing pairBilinear retains f(a,db), f(da,b), f(da,db) as separate terms; both ordered mixed directions and the joint increment remain present.",
    "compatible_generated": "Data fields are actual prefixEvaluator and projection restriction. Compatible is proved from the same indexed source observations by ext/rfl, not passed to a constructor. The restriction drops the last observation and is explicitly a prefix restriction.",
