    "authority": "Original CP116 actual source root/current/material/owner and full runtime history remain. This mathematical coefficient producer does not advance a controller or identify full State Carrier with native coefficient words.",
    "runtime_next_boundary": "Prefixes restrict source observations at fixed original site labels; updateMorphism uses the same material Env+increment and identity generator. No cross-grade runtime-next/liftAction or its quotient-kernel stability is claimed.",
